flowchart TB
  request[HTTP request] --> middleware[Global middleware<br/>request ID, logging, Helmet, rate limits, JSON parsing]
  middleware --> route[Route matching]
  route -->|public endpoint| public[Register / Login / Health]
  route -->|protected endpoint| auth[Authentication<br/>verify JWT and load current user]
  auth --> role[Role authorization<br/>admin-only checks where required]
  public --> validate[Zod request validation]
  role --> validate
  validate --> service[Service layer<br/>business rules]
  service --> prisma[Prisma Client]
  prisma --> database[(PostgreSQL)]
  service --> response[Validated response model<br/>sendJson / Zod]
  middleware -. unhandled error .-> errors[Central error handler<br/>consistent JSON error response]
  validate -. validation / route error .-> errors
